---
description: >-
  PEG syntax (railroad-peg-beta) covering ordered choice (`/`), the `<-`
  rule-definition arrow, and the `+` one-or-more suffix, in an
  arithmetic-expression grammar.
---
railroad-peg-beta
Expression <- Term (("+" / "-") Term)* ;
Term <- Factor (("*" / "/") Factor)* ;
Factor <- Number / "(" Expression ")" ;
Number <- Digit+ ;
Digit <- "0" / "1" / "2" / "3" ;
